on: scripts/manufacturing/export_study.py, public/models/manufacturing-core-full.glb and manufacturing-core-lite.glb; evidence assets/ and gates/core-assets.md. Geometry reduction is preparation only; tooling/progression and G2 acceptance wait for reviewed G0.\n- G1 integration (Leibniz): CameraRig.tsx, TorqueWrenchHero.tsx, InspectionScene.tsx, SceneCanvas.tsx, PostProcessingComposer.tsx; new renderLease.ts/tests and ringRuntime.ts; narrativeFade.ts only as required. Runtime factory root and readiness are explicit typed interfaces. No shaft placeholder scene or missing-asset entry is permitted.\n- Parent owns root GATES.md, this PLAN.md, baseline evidence, review ledger and integration assignments.\n- Runtime verifier owns scripts/verify-manufacturing-inspection.mjs and evidence runtime/ only; it reports shared-source defects to the integration/shell owners and never patches them.\n- Shared integration edits in CameraRig.tsx, TorqueWrenchHero.tsx and InspectionScene.tsx belong to exactly one integration owner at a time. Earlier named assignments below are historical; establish current ownership before resuming edits.\n- Implemented interface baseline: kind ring|shaft; descriptors own duration, chapters and assets; one mutable absolute playhead; CameraRig sole camera writer; versioned manufacturing telemetry with backward-compatible ring telemetry; inspection-local assembled finale; instance-owned cloned resources with stale-session leases. Runtime acceptance remains separate from interface implementation.\n- Every stage has fresh review from a different provider and independently rerun checks. Requested model and observed routing evidence are recorded separately; flags alone are not served-model proof.\n\n## Tree And State\n\nReconciled 2026-10-06 against the final status log, leaf reports, runtime JSON and recovered source. Producer/reviewer completion does not close the overall gates. No listed worker should be assumed to be running from an older assignment.\n\n|