ce-level GLM SHIP; corrected desktop dev-2 has five carriers and exact Return restore | dedicated shaft verifier, corrected narrow finale and fresh production proof | gates/shaft-runtime.md; runtime/shaft-smoke/dev-2/ |\n| Dedicated shaft verifier | NOT DELIVERED: producer exhausted HTTP429 retries | resume shaft-verifier-spec.md; shared lifecycle verifier is a different existing script | shaft-verifier-spec.md; shaft-verifier-sol.log |\n| G2–G6 overall acceptance | OPEN; implemented leaves are not final acceptance | remaining mechanical, asset, production/browser, opening and provider-diverse reviews; owner visual acceptance separate | root GATES.md; leaf gates |\n\n## October 6 continuation ownership\n\nThe owner requested reading the recovered handoff and beginning work after clarifying unresolved decisions. Existing overall and leaf gates remain authoritative; no recovery work is discarded.\n\n| Continuation leaf | State | Owned paths | Acceptance |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Shaft browser verifier | IN-FLIGHT | scripts/verify-shaft-inspection.mjs; runtime/shaft/; gates/shaft-runtime-browser.md | shaft-verifier-spec.md S1-S8, two agreeing runs, independent review and parent rerun |\n| Final follow correction review | VERIFIED SOURCE REVIEW | shaft-follow-independent-review-2026-10-06.md only | SHIP; focused shaft 102/102 and typecheck PASS; final browser proof remains separate |\n| Asset and camera acceptance | GLM SOURCE COMPLETE; native footer correction IN-FLIGHT | src/scene/inspection/shaft/camera.ts and camera.test.ts; assets/acceptance-2026-10-06/; camera/blockout-2026-10-06/; camera/footer-fix-2026-10-06/; gates/core-assets.md; gates/camera.md | mobile collision fixed with parent10/10; C4 recorded, D4/C2 open; fresh native worker corrects desktop-material and narrow-final footer observations using measured geometry |\n| Static shaft visual fallback | VERIFIED STATIC LEAF; final overall review pending | src/components/StaticShaftStory.tsx; RingInspection.tsx StaticShaft wrapper only; ShaftStoryLayer.css static selectors; public/inspection/shaft/; static-shaft-2026-10-06/; gates/static-shaft.md | 16 real raster variants; parent production static4/4 PASS; poster zero CAD/tool, reduced inspection zero manufacturing/tool; whole-narrative reduced-motion V4 decision remains pending |\n| Poster metadata availability | VERIFIED SOURCE AND POSTER BROWSER | src/scene/inspection/story.ts; story.test.ts; src/state/inspectionStore.test.ts; poster-metadata-fix-2026-10-06.md | lightweight metadata with no canvas/factory registration; parent source31/31 and production static4/4 PASS, including cold poster zeroCAD/focus |\n| Verifier independent review corrections | IN-FLIGHT, native code-only worker | scripts/verify-shaft-inspection.mjs; runtime/shaft/review-corrections-2026-10-06/ | six source-backed FIX-FIRST items; static GPU leaf complete; paired shaft production runs await corrected verifier readiness |\n| Reduced-motion product decision | WAITING FOR OWNER | no source ownership assigned yet | static poster throughout versus existing static 3D narrative; dependent work waits for explicit answer |\n| Integration and final review | WAITING | parent owns shared-source assignments, PLAN.md, root GATES.md, review-ledger.md and continuation records | rebuild/restart preview, affected checks, production/runtime/opening proof; owner visual acceptance separate |\n\nNative OpenAI seats review the prior GLM follow correction and produce the substantial verifier; proxy-routed GLM review is planned for new OpenAI deliverables. Requested routing is recorded separately from observed serving attribution. No push/deploy is authorized. A checkpoint commit requires a verified manufacturing-owned set and preservation of the unrelated index.\n\n## Status Log\n\n- 2026-10-06 production continuation: final static source/build checks passed (444 tests, production build, static 4/4 and independent core-export acceptance); D4 is checked and C4 recorded. Came