ionScene), rig lookup through the hero subtree (fixes finale carriers), static DOM shaft study (store throw removed, test updated), \"Inspect the input shaft\" trigger, ShaftStoryLayer mounted in the dialog (column layout, narrow under header), beat labels in status. Dev smoke (runtime/shaft-smoke/dev-1, dev-2): ready in about 2.2-2.8 s, all beats render, supports delta 2.750 mm, finale assembled from 40 s, Return restores focus with pose error 0. Sol shaft verifier dispatched (shaft-verifier-spec.md).\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
