{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_23","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'Get-Content -Raw \"project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/manufacturing-implementation-2026-10-05/continuation-checks-2026-10-06.md\"'","aggregated_output":"# Parent continuation checks — October 6, 2026\n\n## Contact-linked stock correction: current build\n\nThe stricter production shaft check found actual premature stock removal before axial contact. The source correction places40 pass events inside the matching nearest-space material-contact windows and derives prior depth from those events. Parent copied and reran the unchanged numerical helper into `shaft-stock-contact-correction-2026-10-06/parent-rerun/`: exit0,249601samples,40valid gains, all six failure counters0,167591 wholly-disengaged intervals retain depth. All ten spaces complete by12.946510416666667s. Current kinematics SHA256 `2f78847da8cc70b350c7f22eed2c899d6289100f94011dc87533f1dd337bd893`.\n\nParent `npm test -- --maxWorkers=2`: exit0,43files/445tests PASS (`final-contact-tests-2026-10-06.log`). Parent `npm run build`: exit0,703modules,index-DFY-biXM.js/SceneCanvas-CoJldWVG.js (`final-contact-build-2026-10-06.log`). The hidden production preview was started after this build (PID33416,localhost:4173 HTTP200). Earlier preview PIDs below are historical and were no longer listening before this restart.\n\nVerifier cache identity is repaired without tolerance changes; current SHA256 `d26d491acbb8bac0e0803a48e60b01592e6c57eeb0ebc76d15275e213bc87c4a`. Failed historical reports remain diagnostic. Fresh GLM source review and paired parent production runs remain required; the earlier444-test build is superseded for current shaft acceptance. V4 owner policy and owner visual acceptance remain open.\n\nThese checks validate the recovered current code before any new source changes. They do not close browser, mechanical, performance or owner acceptance