7 kB (`final-build-2026-10-06.log`). Preview was restarted after both the intermediate capture build and final build; final PID 26960 serves localhost:4173. Chunk-size advisory remains; this is not performance/deployment approval.\n\nParent static production rerun: the unchanged checker was copied to `runtime/static-parent-final/` to preserve dev evidence, then executed with `--url=http://localhost:4173`. Exit 0; poster-desktop, poster-narrow, reduced-desktop, reduced-narrow all PASS, zero failures. Every real image URL loads; poster has zero total CAD, reduced has zero inspection manufacturing/tool requests with three separately recorded narrative requests. Exact content, six visual parts, responsive assets, 44 px controls, overflow, focus/keyboard/Return/Escape and restoration checks pass in `runtime/static-parent-final/browser-report.json`. V4 whole-narrative reduced-motion choice remains open.\n\nParent production lifecycle rerun: `node scripts/verify-manufacturing-inspection.mjs --url=http://localhost:4173 --out=.../runtime/lifecycle/parent-final-2026-10-06`, exit 1, 12/14 cases PASS. V1/V2/V3/V5 PASS both widths; census and real context-loss subchecks PASS. Exactly two failures remain: reduced-motion desktop/narrow each request the pre-existing three narrative CAD assets. V4 remains unchecked without any assertion waiver. Report and all failure details are preserved; the command's nonzero exit is intentional evidence of that unresolved product gate.\n\n| Check | Result | Deciding evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| `npm test` | Timeout-only failure under parallel load | 438 passed / 440; dense shaft camera continuity and portal depth tests exceeded their unchanged 5-second timeout |\n| `npm test -- --maxWorkers=2` | PASS, exit 0 | 43 files / 440 tests; 30.53 seconds; no source edits or raised timeouts |\n| `node scripts/check-b1b2-contract.mjs` | PASS | 31 passed / 0 failed; synthetic geometry contract only |\n| `npm run check:station2` | PASS | 2,671,600 bytes; seven named roots and seven CAD anchors; AirflowField and AcousticBaffleField mounted |\n| `npm run build` | PASS, exit 0 | 702 transformed modules; 41.92-second Vite build; production index `index-Bhu2ecIu.js`, canvas `SceneCanvas-iWoqN6Ck.js` |\n\nThe default test discovery also includes the pre-existing `.kilo/worktrees/fantasy-feet` airflow suite. No unrelated test/configuration was modified. The total above is the literal executed suite count, not a claim that every discovered file belongs to manufacturing.\n\nBuild retains a chunk-size advisory (sectionRenderPass 684.62 kB raw). Initial entry gzip 82.46 kB exceeds the general hygiene skill's approximate 75 kB target; no deployment readiness or performance acceptance is inferred from build success. These sizes precede any product decision on reduced motion.\n\nFresh production server: `npm run preview -- --host localhost --port 4173 --strictPort`, started after this build. No earlier preview server existed. Evidence writers can trigger Tailwind CSS/HMR on development; completed browser proof should use this preview and record the matching build.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
